{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/page,_N_T_/products/bl-cob093"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/$c$slug/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/3emid448q9z0e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/1u5zan5bs9a7v.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1z99mlp5cofct.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/02fh7_m5mrih8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3ds0w_p-f8s6u.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><title>COB MicroLED 0.9mm | High-Resolution LED Dubai UAE | Brightluxx</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Upgrade your visuals with the COB MicroLED 0.9mm display from Brightluxx Dubai. Perfect for detailed, crisp LED screens in UAE. Call now!\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob093\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"site-header\" data-testid=\"site-header-nav\"><div class=\"site-header__inner\"><a class=\"site-logo\" data-testid=\"logo-link\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary navigation\"><button data-testid=\"nav-products\">PRODUCTS <span>⌄</span></button><button data-testid=\"nav-solutions\">SOLUTIONS <span>⌄</span></button><a data-testid=\"nav-lumimorph\" href=\"/lumimorph\">LUMIMORPH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-naturatex\" href=\"/naturatex\">NATURATEX</a><a data-testid=\"nav-signatouch\" href=\"/signatouch\">SIGNATOUCH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-glassmorph\" href=\"/glassmorph\">GLASSMORPH</a><button data-testid=\"nav-more-btn\">☰ <span>⌄</span></button></nav><button class=\"mobile-menu-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" data-testid=\"mobile-menu-toggle\">☰</button></div></header><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"COB MicroLED 0.9mm\", \"description\": \"Purpose-built for close-viewing applications where every pixel matters. Full flip-chip COB with 20,000:1 contrast delivers cinema-grade immersion in executive suites and flagship retail environments.\", \"sku\": \"BL-COB093\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob093\", \"category\": \"cob-microled\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-cob093.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 2500, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob093\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"0.93mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"600 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"640 x 360 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the COB MicroLED 0.9mm and why does it matter?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 0.93mm, which means pixels are very close together for ultra-fine image detail and sharpness, ideal for close viewing environments like home cinemas and executive suites.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What technology does this LED display use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It uses full flip-chip COB (Chip on Board) technology offering high contrast and uniform brightness, ensuring cinema-grade image quality with deep blacks and vivid colors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the COB MicroLED 0.9mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display delivers a brightness of 600 nits, providing excellent visibility in controlled indoor environments without glare or washout.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What installation options are available for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display features front magnetic serviceability, making maintenance and servicing easy by allowing front access to modules without needing rear access.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare with traditional LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to traditional LED options, the COB MicroLED offers finer pixel pitch (0.93mm), higher contrast (20,000:1), and superior color depth, producing more immersive visuals and seamless images perfect for premium interiors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the COB MicroLED 0.9mm suitable for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No, this product is designed specifically for premium indoor environments like flagship retail and executive suites due to its brightness level and construction.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and certifications does this LED display have?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It comes with UL and CE certifications meeting international safety and quality standards, with Brightluxx providing reliable aftersales support and warranty details upon purchase inquiry.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this display be customized in size or shape for different interior designs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the modular design of COB MicroLED panels weighing 6 kg each allows flexible configurations to fit bespoke interior layouts and achieve seamless visuals for various room sizes.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"COB MicroLED 0.9mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob093\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>COB MicroLED 0.9mm</h1><p>Upgrade your visuals with the COB MicroLED 0.9mm display from Brightluxx Dubai. Perfect for detailed, crisp LED screens in UAE. Call now!</p><p><strong>Cinema-grade COB for premium interiors.</strong></p><p>Purpose-built for close-viewing applications where every pixel matters. Full flip-chip COB with 20,000:1 contrast delivers cinema-grade immersion in executive suites and flagship retail environments.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the COB MicroLED 0.9mm and why does it matter?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 0.93mm, which means pixels are very close together for ultra-fine image detail and sharpness, ideal for close viewing environments like home cinemas and executive suites.</p><h3>What technology does this LED display use?</h3><p>It uses full flip-chip COB (Chip on Board) technology offering high contrast and uniform brightness, ensuring cinema-grade image quality with deep blacks and vivid colors.</p><h3>How bright is the COB MicroLED 0.9mm?</h3><p>This display delivers a brightness of 600 nits, providing excellent visibility in controlled indoor environments without glare or washout.</p><h3>What installation options are available for this product?</h3><p>The display features front magnetic serviceability, making maintenance and servicing easy by allowing front access to modules without needing rear access.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"site-footer\" data-testid=\"footer\"><div class=\"site-footer__inner\"><section class=\"site-footer__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><p>Premium LED display solutions for UAE and MENA. Established since 2005.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" data-testid=\"footer-social-instagram\">◎</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" data-testid=\"footer-social-linkedin\">in</a></div></section><section><h2>EXPLORE</h2><a href=\"/products\">PRODUCTS</a><a href=\"/solutions\">SOLUTIONS</a><a href=\"/technology\">TECHNOLOGY</a><a href=\"/case-studies\">CASE STUDIES</a><a href=\"/blog\">BLOG</a></section><section><h2>LOCATIONS</h2><a href=\"/dubai\">DUBAI</a><a href=\"/abu-dhabi\">ABU DHABI</a><a href=\"/saudi-arabia\">SAUDI ARABIA</a><a href=\"/qatar\">QATAR</a><a href=\"/kuwait\">KUWAIT</a><a href=\"/bahrain\">BAHRAIN</a><a href=\"/oman\">OMAN</a></section><section><h2>COMPANY</h2><a href=\"/about\">ABOUT US</a><a href=\"/contact\">CONTACT US</a><a href=\"/factory-tour\">FACTORY TOUR</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a><a href=\"/resources\">RESOURCES</a></section><section><h2>CONTACT</h2><a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=Je