\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe pixel pitch is 0.93mm, which means pixels are very close together for ultra-fine image detail and sharpness, ideal for close viewing environments like home cinemas and executive suites.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat technology does this LED display use?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIt uses full flip-chip COB (Chip on Board) technology offering high contrast and uniform brightness, ensuring cinema-grade image quality with deep blacks and vivid colors.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow bright is the COB MicroLED 0.9mm?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis display delivers a brightness of 600 nits, providing excellent visibility in controlled indoor environments without glare or washout.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat installation options are available for this product?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe display features front magnetic serviceability, making maintenance and servicing easy by allowing front access to modules without needing rear access.\\u003c/p\\u003e18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$19\\\"}}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\nc:null\\n11:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"COB MicroLED 0.9mm | High-Resolution LED Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Upgrade your visuals with the COB MicroLED 0.9mm display from Brightluxx Dubai. Perfect for detailed, crisp LED screens in UAE. Call now!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob093\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3