 {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 0.93mm, which means pixels are very close together for ultra-fine image detail and sharpness, ideal for close viewing environments like home cinemas and executive suites.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What technology does this LED display use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It uses full flip-chip COB (Chip on Board) technology offering high contrast and uniform brightness, ensuring cinema-grade image quality with deep blacks and vivid colors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the COB MicroLED 0.9mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display delivers a brightness of 600 nits, providing excellent visibility in controlled indoor environments without glare or washout.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What installation options are available for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display features front magnetic serviceability, making maintenance and servicing easy by allowing front access to modules without needing rear access.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare with traditional LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to traditional LED options, the COB MicroLED offers finer pixel pitch (0.93mm), higher contrast (20,000:1), and superior color depth, producing more immersive visuals and seamless images perfect for premium interiors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the COB MicroLED 0.9mm suitable for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No, this product is designed specifically for premium indoor environments like flagship retail and executive suites due to its brightness level and construction.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and certifications does this LED display have?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It comes with UL and CE certifications meeting international safety and quality standards, with Brightluxx providing reliable aftersales support and warranty details upon purchase inquiry.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this display be customized in size or shape for different interior designs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the modular design of COB MicroLED panels weighing 6 kg each allows flexible configurations to fit bespoke interior layouts and achieve seamless visuals for various room sizes.\"}}]}9:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$13\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}],\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\"],\"$L18\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"COB MicroLED 0.9mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob093\\\"}]}\"}}]\n16:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-