</p><p><strong>Cinema-grade COB for premium interiors.</strong></p><p>Purpose-built for close-viewing applications where every pixel matters. Full flip-chip COB with 20,000:1 contrast delivers cinema-grade immersion in executive suites and flagship retail environments.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the COB MicroLED 0.9mm and why does it matter?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 0.93mm, which means pixels are very close together for ultra-fine image detail and sharpness, ideal for close viewing environments like home cinemas and executive suites.</p><h3>What technology does this LED display use?</h3><p>It uses full flip-chip COB (Chip on Board) technology offering high contrast and uniform brightness, ensuring cinema-grade image quality with deep blacks and vivid colors.</p><h3>How bright is the COB MicroLED 0.9mm?</h3><p>This display delivers a brightness of 600 nits, providing excellent visibility in controlled indoor environments without glare or washout.</p><h3>What installation options are available for this product?</h3><p>The display features front magnetic serviceability, making maintenance and servicing easy by allowing front access to modules without needing rear access.</p>18:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$19\"}}]\nf:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nc:null\n11:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"COB MicroLED 0.9mm | High-Resolution LED Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Upgrade your visuals with the COB MicroLED 0.9mm display from Brightluxx Dubai. Perfect for detailed, crisp LED screens in UAE. Call now!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cob093\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T58f,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"COB Mic